{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は沈金でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週もゲストは豪華2組！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず21時台は\n水谷果穂さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ内でも言いましたが\n可愛すぎて気になってたので\n会えて嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女優さんと会える機会はなかなか無いしねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『1819』いただいちゃったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22時台は\n東京女子流から\n庄司芽生さんと中江友梨さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、めいてぃんと中江！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔から大好きな女子流さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお会いできて幸せでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/02/26/7191274/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いだらけの\n幸せな2時間でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくれてありがとう～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n「埼玉サイクルエキスポ2017」\nさゆにゃん、まいちゅんと出演してきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、バカボン鬼塚さんがMCです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前も来たばかりのSSAですね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧券もう配っちゃってますが\n抽選ですが\nみなさんGetしたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さる方は\nこの後よろしくね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}